OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of geese fill the skies
OL,4,Aof southern Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe skies of southern Scotland are
OL,7,Fbeing filled once again with thousands
OL,8,Fof geese arriving to winter on the
OL,9,FSolway Firth.
OL,11,FOne of the best seats in the house is
OL,12,Foffered at the Wildfowl and Wetlands
OL,13,FTrust's (WWT's) Caerlaverock centre.
OL,15,FThe number of geese wintering there has
OL,16,Fgrown from about 300 in the 1940s to
OL,17,Fmore than 40,000.
OL,19,FA community art exhibition called The
OL,20,FNever Ending Skein has even been
OL,21,Fcreated to celebrate the arrival of the
OL,22,Fbirds.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
